## 2. Key Components Built & Integrated

### A. Database Schema (`assistant_action_proposals`)
- Created `assistant_action_proposals` table in MySQL to persist proposal state (`id`, `action_type`, `target_entity`, `target_id`, `requested_params`, `reason`, `status`, `expires_at`, `executed_at`).

### B. 4 Controlled Action Proposal Tools
1. 🚩 `proposeFlagCase(caseId, priority, reason)`
2. 📝 `proposeAddCaseNote(caseId, noteText)`
3. 🔄 `proposeTriggerReanalysis(caseId, reason)`
4. 🚨 `proposeEscalateAlert(caseId, escalationLevel, message)`

### C. Server-Side Execution Service & Endpoints
- [`assistantAction.service.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/services/assistantAction.service.js):
  - Validates proposal exists, is pending, and has not expired.
  - Enforces RBAC permissions.
  - Executes mutation & updates status to `executed`.
  - Inserts comprehensive audit log record in `audit_logs`.
- Endpoints mounted on [`assistant.routes.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/routes/assistant.routes.js):
  - `POST /api/assistant/actions/confirm`
  - `POST /api/assistant/actions/dismiss`

### D. Interactive Action Proposal Cards in Copilot
- [`AiCopilotPanel.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/frontend/src/components/AiCopilotPanel.jsx):
  - Standout action card rendered directly inside the chat thread.
  - Real-time confirmation buttons (`[Confirm Action]`, `[Dismiss]`).
  - Dynamic visual state changes (`PENDING` ➔ `LOADING` ➔ `✅ EXECUTED` or `DISMISSED`).

